Third-party software redistributed in published artifacts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Published packages in this repository ship pre-built bundles. `packages/cli`
bundles its production dependency closure into `dist/cli.mjs` with esbuild
configured `legalComments: "none"` (packages/cli/scripts/finalize-bundle.mjs:50),
and `@aexhq/sdk` republishes that bundle as its `aex` binary. The bundler strips
the upstream copyright headers, so the attributions those licenses require are
collected here instead.

Every entry below is MIT licensed. The MIT licence text is reproduced once at the
end of this file; it is the same text for every entry.

  @standard-schema/spec   https://github.com/standard-schema/standard-schema
                          Copyright (c) 2024 Standard Schema contributors

  fflate                  https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate
                          Copyright (c) 2023 Arjun Barrett

  ignore                  https://github.com/kaelzhang/node-ignore
                          Copyright (c) 2013 Kael Zhang and contributors

  zod                     https://github.com/colinhacks/zod
                          Copyright (c) 2020 Colin McDonnell

`scripts/validate/package-metadata.test.ts` asserts that every production
dependency of every publishable package in this repository appears above. Adding
a runtime dependency to a published package without recording it here fails that
gate.

